WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.975
When a jury member cuts you off, don’t stop.

2
00:00:04.015 --> 00:00:08.551
Stay calm, and ask politely: may I finish my sentence?

3
00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:10.607
Thirty seconds is enough.

4
00:00:10.647 --> 00:00:14.893
A good jury listens. A good candidate keeps the thread.
